== Tips==
* The '''Stash''' offers a solution to the storage problem plaguing the [[Rift Dimension]] : players can force redirect items such as {{Item|Coven Seal}}s.

== Trivia ==
* The  '''Stash''' is likely inspired from The Pit's [https://pit.wiki/Stash Stash] feature.

